uld change the HUD. Hmm.\n\nOR: $07ED/$07EE might be part of the sprite/nametable buffer. Hmm.\n\nLet me directly find what writes $07EE by using trace_writes during the coin — I still need it.\n\nHmm, let me reconsider: In the earlier successful coin (play_inp","truncated":true}
